{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/conj-chain-ring-comparison","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Conjecture","doco:Section"],"label":"conj:chain-ring-comparison","kind":"conjecture","title":"Predicted vs. observed $\\mathrm{C}_6$ ring-closure barrier","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-chain-ring-energy"],"tags":["comparison","experimental","theoretical","activation-energy","benzene","carbyne","ring-closure","substrate-parameter"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Organic.benzene_weights","text":"chain-ring-comparison.md","leanSource":"chain-ring-comparison.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"conj:chain-ring-comparison\"></a><p><strong>Theoretical prediction.</strong>\nThe energy difference between the chain and threaded ring is proportional to the difference in reduced Alexander weights:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\Delta E\n   \\propto \n  \\bigl[(N-1) - \\tilde\\Delta_{T(2,N)}(q)\\bigr]\n  \\cdot |q + q^{-1}|_{\\mathrm{mol}}.</code></pre>\n<p>For <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">N = 6</code> with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">|q + q^{-1}|_{\\mathrm{mol}} \\sim 1\\text{--}2</code> eV and weight difference <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">5 - 3 = 2</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\Delta E(6)\n   \\sim \n  2 \\times (1\\text{--}2 \\mathrm{eV})\n   \\sim \n  2\\text{--}4 \\mathrm{eV}\n   \\approx \n  193\\text{--}386 \\mathrm{kJ/mol}.</code></pre>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/organic-chemistry/chain-ring-comparison.md","heading":"Conjecture","number":"19.3.4","page":"b/conj-chain-ring-comparison","qa":{"counts":{"pass":87,"fail":1,"warn":1,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":75},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Organic.benzene_weights","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/organic-chemistry/chain-ring-comparison.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
